{"ticker":"PARADEEP","symbol":"PARADEEP","instrumentId":3180219,"name":"Paradeep Phospha","industry":"NSE-Chemicals-Agricultural","about":"Paradeep Phosphates Ltd. is a prominent Indian fertilizer manufacturer, specializing in the production of Di-Ammonium Phosphate (DAP), NPK, and other complex fertilizers. The company operates a large manufacturing facility in Odisha, equipped with advanced technology to produce high-quality fertilizers that enhance soil fertility and crop yield. Serving farmers across India, Paradeep Phosphates plays a crucial role in supporting the agricultural sector with its nutrient-rich products. The company’s extensive distribution network ensures easy accessibility of its fertilizers to farmers, promoting sustainable agricultural practices. Paradeep Phosphates is committed to contributing to India’s food security by providing reliable and efficient nutrient solutions.","website":"www.paradeepphosphates.com","location":null,"exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:47:35.884Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":137.79,"changePct":-0.8562383076701667,"week52High":165.88,"week52Low":103.19},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹14,310 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹23,939 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"436,178,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"168"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"260,137,222"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"1.09%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"2.11"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"0.7"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"12.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"-0.03"},{"label":"Beta","value":"1.2"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"16%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"16.82"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"6–69"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"14.7%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"-9.75"},{"label":"Volume","value":"1,629,176"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"2,595,476"},{"label":"Master score","value":"46"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"36"},{"label":